---
description: CyTube project entrypoint and file-backed lifecycle
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md`. Bootstrap only:

- `blueprint/context/project-overview.md`
- `blueprint/context/current-feature.md`
- `blueprint/context/session-handoff.md`

Inspect git state, then load only the active `Context manifest`. Canonical rules
live in `.agents/rules/*.md`; canonical skills live in `.agents/skills/`.

Work process: `status -> feature/fix -> approve spec -> implement -> check -> complete`.
Do not implement non-trivial work without an approved spec.

Pre-build: run `/prototype` before the first real UI feature.

This repo has no test framework. The gate is `./.agents/check-baseline.sh`, which
fails only on NEW errors. Repo starts green at onboarding.
